Z||000026||Archie||04-27-2001||09:17 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KissMySSFiero:<BR><B>hey archie id like to meet up with you all.  now i just have to ffind that oasis.  hehe.  im hopin on gettin my uncle to go with me so he can see a v8 car first hand.   <P>archie..  are you given rides in any of your cars?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>From NWest IN, take I-94/I-80 West, catch I-294 North. Go North past the Hinsdale rest area.... do a "flip-flop" and return to the Southbound Hinsdale Oasis.<P>The thing at Bob's typically becomes very busy..... what with the Food, door prizes and the Power Tour thing this year. But, If the weather holds and we have time, I'll be giving a few rides.<P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 04-27-2001).]||||reg||1
